'''Heart Beat''' (心がぴょんぴょん, ''Kokoro ga Pyonpyon'', '''Hopping Heart''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 2.

==Effect==
"Slow" Effect UP (Sm): Slow duration increases by 10%.

==Combo==
