}}

==Trivia==
*Heart Beat's Japanese name, Kokoro ga Pyonpyon ("Heart is Hopping"), is a reference to "Kokoro pyonpyon machi?" ("Is your heart ready to hop?") the first lyric from [[wikipedia:Is the Order a Rabbit?|''Is the Order a Rabbit?'']]'s first opening, "[https://youtu.be/YfRPN3ryL2Y Daydream Café]".
**The anime's title explains why [[The White Rabbit (Uber Rare Cat)|The White Rabbit]] is in the Combo.

